From: OpenWrt <openwrt@openwrt.org>
Subject: [PATCH] arm: boot: compressed: disable fortify in atags_to_fdt

The decompressor runs without the full kernel runtime. With kernel fortify
enabled, memcpy() in merge_fdt_bootargs() generates references to
warn_slowpath_fmt and a .data..once section, neither of which exists in the
compressed boot link. Define __NO_FORTIFY before including headers.

Signed-off-by: OpenWrt <openwrt@openwrt.org>
---
 arch/arm/boot/compressed/atags_to_fdt.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm/boot/compressed/atags_to_fdt.c
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/compressed/atags_to_fdt.c
@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+#define __NO_FORTIFY
+
 #include <linux/libfdt_env.h>
 #include <asm/setup.h>
 #include <libfdt.h>
